# Assignment 3 – Project Presentation

## Project Title
IoT-Based Smart Helmet for Accident Detection and Rider Safety

## Project Description
This project is an IoT-based safety system designed to improve rider safety through accident detection and monitoring.

## Implemented Features
- Accident detection using sensors
- GPS location tracking
- SMS alerts using GSM
- Alcohol detection
- Drowsiness detection

## Project GitHub Repository
https://github.com/anithamaheswari/smart-helmet-accident-detection

## Project Challenges
This project was challenging because I had to integrate multiple sensors and hardware modules to detect accidents, alcohol consumption and drowsiness.

I worked on connecting GPS and GSM modules to track the rider's location and send SMS alerts during emergencies.

The most challenging part was making all the components work together reliably and testing the complete system.
